WEBVTT

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.140
Yuki...

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:17.480
This impossible dream can only
disappear into oblivion.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.890
I had a dream.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.460
Kanata-san!

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.800
Yuki.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.140
Have you gotten used to college life yet?

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.100
Yes, I think so.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.810
In my dream, I was a college student,

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:56.320
attending the same university as Kanata-san,
who was now a graduate student.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:03.200
Once a week, we'd visit the Asahi Orphanage

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.660
to play with the children and laugh.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.520
Sometimes, we'd lose track of the time
and stay up all night,

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.790
discussing our dreams for the future.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:19.920
I dreamed a sad dream of a simple life.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:40.110
If this dream can never be reality,
may I never wake.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:45.450
That kind-hearted Kanata-san is gone...

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:52.710
Only I know your pain...

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:55.210
Your uncertainty...

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:58.540
Your loneliness...

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:03.290
If only we could be together forever.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:09.640
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.900
I will not betray you!

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:04.890
Bound by Contract

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.040
I hope Yuki-chan's all right.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.750
I can't believe he's been
asleep two whole days.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.230
It must have been quite a shock for him.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.670
Indeed.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.820
Damn it! How did this happen?

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.450
Yuki-kun must be suffering.

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:26.640
The man he trusted turned out to be Reiga.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.440
If only we could heal the
wound in his heart...

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:37.170
This will be more difficult for Yuki than
any battle he has faced previously.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:01.460
I'll cheer up Yuki!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.680
Yuki... Good boy, good boy.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:08.270
Yuki!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:11.940
Who?

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:15.430
I love you, Yuki! I love you!

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:16.990
Is that you, Sodom?

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.270
I'm all grown up.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.950
Seems he's been worried about you, too.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.650
He stayed by your side this whole time.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.570
Thank you, Sodom.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:33.120
My master's happy you woke up.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.580
Sorry to worry you...

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.050
Don't rush yourself.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:45.510
I'm fine, really.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.850
Good morning!

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:50.830
Yuki-chan!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:51.790
Yuki!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.690
Sorry for making all of you worry.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.810
I'm fine now.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.990
That looks delicious!

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:14.300
Uh, should you really be walking around?

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.000
I'm fine! Here.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:20.880
I'll serve the salad.
Should I use these plates?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.670
Ah, yes...

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.890
Did you grow these herbs, Toma-san?

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.220
Yeah...

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.370
They seem like they'd be good for you.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.130
I'll make sure everyone eats plenty.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:54.410
Yuki, I'm grateful for your help in cleaning up,
but you shouldn't push too much.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.890
I'm fine. I feel great.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:01.820
Yuki...

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:04.670
Luka.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:09.090
Should you be moving around like that?

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.600
I'm fine.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.600
Don't overdo it.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:22.150
Keeping busy makes me feel better.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.160
Yuki, what is that?

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:44.130
I hope these will do something
to protect everyone...

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:01.890
Luka's so concerned about Yuki-chan,
he can't help himself.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:13.230
Yuki's trying so hard to keep us
from worrying about him.

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.200
Yeah.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.000
But I'm worried about you, too.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:24.920
That Duras, Ashley, said you want to die.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:33.720
Is it true, Shusei?
Do you really want to die?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.770
Until now, I thought I could go on living,
as long as you needed me.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:46.780
You were my reason to fight
and my reason to live.

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:50.240
What are you talking about?
What's with the past tense?

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:56.370
You love Yuki, don't you?

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:57.870
What?

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.060
D-D-D-Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.870
Of course not!
Of course I don't!

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:03.960
Listen, Hotsuma.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.440
You're not the only one who loves Yuki.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.340
I feel the same way about him.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:18.220
So do Tsukumo and Toko.
All the other Zweilts...

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.640
Everyone living here harbors
special feelings for Yuki.

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:29.260
Yuki is the source of our lives.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:35.070
He gives us the strength to live,
heals our wounds, and even shares our pain.

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:39.540
How could we not love him?

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.580
You're right.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:48.920
But what does that have to do
with your wanting to die?

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:55.590
I believe Yuki can quench your thirst.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:00.210
So you'll be fine without me...

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.890
It doesn't have to be this way!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.810
You idiot!

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.480
You're right.
We have to protect Yuki.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:19.080
But you're my one and only partner,
whom I trust with my life!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:21.060
I'm sorry,

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:24.460
but I don't think I can do it anymore.

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:25.670
Why not?!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.130
Don't make me tell you.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:33.300
Say it! Or do you mean I don't
deserve to be your partner?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.870
That's not it!

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.390
What, then?

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.230
What is it?!

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:52.280
You're too rough.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:56.490
Sorry...

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:02.910
Every time you see these,
you look so pained.

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:09.330
Don't these scars weigh on you?

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.220
<i>You don't need to hide it.</i>

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:20.390
<i>I gave you this wound.</i>

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:28.810
As long as I bear these indelible scars,
I will cause you pain.

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:33.320
So it would be better if I just disappeared!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.660
I'm sorry, Shusei.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:43.080
I'll never turn away from these wounds again.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.910
I'll never run from myself

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.370
or from you again.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.880
Yeah. Me, neither.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:01.260
All done...

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:05.970
Are you tired, Yuki?
I'm worried about you.

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:11.330
I'm sorry, Sodom. I don't know.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.730
Things can't keep on the way they have.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:18.030
I've been averting my eyes from so much,

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:21.120
running away from so many things.

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:27.860
I've been so afraid to face the truth,
I've been stuck thinking about the past.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:41.180
I just didn't want to think all my memories
of Kanata-san were a lie.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:45.720
I can't stop now, but...

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:54.110
I always have to be saved by Luka.
I'm powerless to do anything.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.150
Luka.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.230
Yuki.

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.110
Do you have a minute?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.740
Are you doing okay?

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:49.200
You always watch over him,
but he may never remember who you were.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.350
It doesn't matter how I feel.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:57.330
All that matters is that Yuki's happy.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.710
What?

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.390
How can you say something so sad?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:05.540
If you're suffering, let's talk about it.
I'm sure you'll-

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.600
I don't want that.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:09.720
But...

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:15.030
But you were lovers.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:19.440
I'm sure Yuki-chan...

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.630
Yuki wants to forget.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.120
To forget?

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:33.410
This time, Yuki was reborn as a man.

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:41.860
If your dying wish really does
affect your next life,

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:45.840
then Yuki didn't choose to relive
the same life as a woman.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.420
That is his answer.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:53.110
That's far too sad.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.140
Didn't you love each other?

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.910
It's all in the past.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.430
Luka...

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.660
Toko-chan.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:11.510
Tsukumo, Yuki-chan.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:13.950
Where's Luka?

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.340
He was here just a minute ago.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:18.250
I'll go look for him!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.500
Master! Master!

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:26.420
You don't need to force
yourself to try so hard.

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.690
I'm not...

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:34.720
We know you're making yourself smile.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:39.940
We're all worried about you.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.460
Luka most of all...

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.440
I...

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:48.530
I don't want to keep Luka bound any longer!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:50.870
Master?

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.280
I've been thinking about
it for some time now.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:16:01.170
I don't know that it's right for me to keep
Luka bound by some ancient contract.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:07.120
If keeping Luka by my side
is causing him pain,

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.390
I want to set him free.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.470
You're wrong!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.380
He wants to be by your side.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:17.400
He doesn't think of himself as tied to you.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:21.770
She's right. He decided to protect you.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.070
Listen, Yuki-chan.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:32.740
The reason Luka stays by your side is...

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:37.250
Am I standing in your way?

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:41.170
Luka.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:49.750
I didn't mean...

00:16:56.900 --> 00:16:58.270
I...

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:03.610
Don't be afraid.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:12.060
Whether or not I'm bound by a contract...

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:16.400
Whether or not I'm somewhere inside you...

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.220
I will stay by your side.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.260
Are you happy with that?

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:46.660
If it makes you unhappy,
cancel the contract.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.550
Why do you do so much for me?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.290
Because you're important to me.

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:08.170
Isn't that enough?

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.880
Exactly, Yuki.

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:18.510
Hotsuma-kun, Shusei-kun...

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:24.340
We know you're suffering because of Kanata,
but you're not alone.

00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:25.900
We're here for you.

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:33.240
Yuki, no matter what happens,
Hotsuma and I will shield you.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.910
As will we, Yuki-chan.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:41.620
It's because we all love you, Yuki.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:46.290
I love you, Yuki!
We love you!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.970
I'll beat the crap out of you
if you ever say you're alone again.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:53.510
What are you talking about?
You'd never do that.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:56.430
<i>Because we all love you.</i>

00:18:56.430 --> 00:19:00.130
That was all I wanted to hear.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:04.770
Simple words, stronger and warmer
than any other bond.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:08.690
Thank you, everyone.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:22.510
Ibuki...

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.440
Yes?

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.360
Tell Fuyutoki to begin preparations
for the ritual.

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.500
Yes, sir.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:35.470
And call Yuki here.

00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:37.800
Understood.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.420
Thank you.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.270
What's wrong?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:27.300
I wish I could remember more about you.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.150
That way, I could...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.190
Yuki-kun.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:37.360
Tachibana-san?

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:39.990
A message from the boss.

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.610
From Takashiro-san?

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:46.680
If you're feeling better, he'd like you to go
to the Kamakura residence tomorrow.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:53.210
The boss probably has something
important to discuss with you...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:57.170
The history of the Giou Clan.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.680
Something important?

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:04.600
Yes. After hearing it,

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:08.060
something may change inside you.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:10.830
It's that important.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.000
Will you go?

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:17.480
I'll go!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.240
Let me go!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.630
Did you hear, Kuroto?

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:35.940
What?

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.970
Apparently, Takashiro-san invited Yuki here.

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.220
Then we'll have to make preparations.

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:50.770
You're right.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:56.190
If Yuki's coming to the main residence,
they'll almost certainly

00:21:56.560 --> 00:21:57.950
attack.

00:23:35.520 --> 00:23:37.960
Tsukumo? Are you snacking again?

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:38.790
Yeah.

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:41.710
Didn't you just have dinner and
two slices of cake for dessert?

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:43.960
Yeah, but there's still room for snacks.

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:45.860
You can eat all you want, without getting fat!

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:46.780
Truth

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:48.720
No fair, no fair, no fair!

00:23:48.720 --> 00:23:50.160
What are you mad at me for?
